    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UNkulunkulu wasesithi kuJakobe: Suka uye eBhetheli, uhlale khona, wakhe khona ialithare uNkulunkulu owabonakala kuwe ekubalekeleni umfowenu uEsawu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJakobe wayesethi endlini yakhe nakubo bonke ababe naye: “Susani onkulunkulu bezizweni abaphakathi kwenu, nizihlambulule, niguqule izingubo zenu.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Masisuke, sikhuphukele eBethele; ngiyakumenzela khona uNkulunkulu i-altare owangiphendula osukwini lokuhlupheka kwami, waba nami endleleni engahamba ngayo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bamnika uJakobe zonke izithixo zabezizwe ezazisesandleni sabo, namacici ayesezindlebeni zabo; uJakobe wakuthukusa phansi kwesihlahla somtholo esasiseShekemi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basuka, ukwesaba uNkulunkulu kwaba phezu kwemizi eyayibazungezile, kabawasukelanga amadodana kaJakobe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJakobe wafika eLuze esezweni laseKhanani eliyiBethele, yena nabantu bonke ababe naye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakha khona i-altare, wayiqamba indawo ngokuthi i-Elibeti-Eli, ngokuba uNkulunkulu wabonakala kuye lapho ebalekela umfowabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kepha uDebora umzanyana kaRebeka wafa, wembelwa phansi kweBethele phansi kwe-oki, igama lalo labizwa ngokuthi i-Alonibhakuti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UNkulunkulu waphinda wabonakala kuJakobe ekuphumeni kwakhe ePhadani Aramu, wambusisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UNkulunkulu wasesithi kuye: Ibizo lakho nguJakobe; igama lakho alisayikuthiwa uJakobe, kepha igama lakho liyakuba ngu-Israyeli; waqamba igama layo ngokuthi u-Israyeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UNkulunkulu wathi kuye: “NginguNkulunkulu, uMninimandla onke; zalani nande; isizwe nesizwe sezizwe kuyakuvela kuwe, namakhosi ayakuphuma okhalweni lwakho;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izwe engalinika u-Abrahama no-Isaka ngiyakulinika wena, nenzalo yakho emva kwakho ngiyakulinika izwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.35.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.35.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 35:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
