              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "UJakobe wamisa itshe lesikhumbuzo phezu kwethuna lakhe; liyitshe lesikhumbuzo sethuna likaRaheli kuze kube lamuhla.",
          "type": "text",
